    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giing'ooyda Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'asheanda rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil aba badayda Babeli, aba iita ng'eanyiida eemeeda Galdayo, aba ghuuta Yeremiya was sibaneeda:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba ghang'eada wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa eemeeda jea gang'uchi sea niny, ak gayghwanung' ghoah ng'eanyiidaanyi raghoonyeanda, ak ea maygwanda siida jea goobiida jeeda; siida ghana diyeayda, gaygamng'aw sean ea gwasheagiidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak aba askwearjoojigiga ea aba damandida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, fuga Israeli sea fuga Yuda gayghabwat geat, ak gooyeawdean nea ghapka; ak gaygagasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobeariida naweeda gal Sayuni, nea googeal iheenga nyaawa heeda mida, nea gwayi, ‘Apkaani eekuuyeewana geat NG'UTAMIIDA aba neajeeda manda muudeanooda maygwaroosa fih.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buuneedeanyu niiw gisilga saawa googeal iheenga giijeega; ak ghabeawa giijeeda ea ghwahita heayeeda, ak ea niroosa hilgweanda nyaawa fuufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga sean nyas saawa ghwaak, nea gwayi weajoodiga nyaawa, ‘Aseasa mandaneasa giidiinyeanda, aba gideaba nisin riing'eeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, was giibinda nyaawa bea huumwa, NG'UTAMIIDA, was dea ghus ghweaniga nyaawa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amng'awa ariiteawana bugusta Babeli, ak gooriteawi ng'eanyiida fuga Galdayo, ak goowuurjeewi ghwarayga mida madeeda nooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'ula, gaydasadu eemoojiga saang'a jea gwaleabu ng'eanyiida mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ghapka gang'uchi Babeli; ak gaygwajip geat aba madeadaanyi. Hean ghang'eada hoowa gajeayaat; Geatka nyaawa gawuurji siida nal fuwean maygabiigu nea ghaghus geatinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'eanyiida Galdayo majeepuusa gil; nea fuga sean geanda haleanjeeda gaygwalang'u, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Israeli gabiigu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Israeli gisilleanda hoona ng'anyeeka ea gwasheagiidi. Aba madeeda sugoocheanda Ashuru gil dea ak niny, ak ghamneawa aba huuydeanda ea Nebukadreesa gil was sugoocheanda Babeli was dea hirjeaweada geakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli: Ng'ula, gaydalas sugoocheanda Babeli ea ng'eanyiidaanyi, gawuurji gidaghayi aalasti sugoocheanda Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadeelsa Israeli ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ak gayghwaak booga jea ghwaheas uhuuda giijeega Garmeli ea Bashani, ak gaygwalang'u aba uhuuda heayeeniga Efraimu ea Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba askwearjoojigiga ea aba damandida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, munyinda gajeegeanda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli, ak ea maygwanda, ghana riing'eeda aba ng'eanyiida Yuda, ak ea mwajeanyas earahay, aba gideaba aniini gaydasamsa fugiga ghayi aabuuchi ghoah boosteangean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda ASEETA aba badayda Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aleaydiit! Mang'aweanyeeka ea gea salda aba ng'eanyiida Babeli ghapka gwarukwiida aba hoowa bea Sayuniin mureandooda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA, was mureandooda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aguursiina fuga jakiida geatka ang'ucheewana Babeli ayaada buuneesean nal gwaradu ghuweang'da. Aneaweesiina mujiini; adaghawapta eara siyagi. Awalda mureandooda aba giteena giidiinyeanyeekaaschi; asimana gidasima buuneeda suurja aba gideaba nisin ghwarjeeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, was dea asagi Ghaydit bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba nih gheareemangaaschi gaygoobeedeayi aba naweadingaaschi hees, sea fugaaschi bea ng'ucheeda sean gajealas uhuuda eaweedida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: Fuga Israeli sisawan, sea fuga Yuda sisawanuudayi sea saawa; nea fuga ghayi ang'waay saawa ea niing'waay muuchi, ak ghaheawa gwasiksa gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lealnoocheanda nyaawa ea majeek; NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega gheawungaaschi. NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega. Niny gayghaweadeagwa muuchi ak abeeda ghwanung' gamnyeeni ng'eanyiida nea goodeawiit fuga abiita Babeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gaygwandeayi diyeanga jarooda sea habiyoojiga Babeli, nea gwandeayi sea shageergweega; ak ea maygoobiida buuneeda earahay, ak ea maygoobiida buuneeda aba seaygoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji damanda ghayi ng'uta ASEETA Sodoma ea Gomora ea mujiinajeega neekeewa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, asi manda siida jea goobiida hoowa, ak ea manda siida was rabascheanda jea goobiida jeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
